This project requires an additional evsrestapi-util.jar file installed as a maven dependency.
That jar file is in a local extlib directory and must be installed as follows:

mvn install:install-file -Dfile=extlib/evsrestapi-util.jar -DgroupId=gov.nih.nci.evs.restapi -DartifactId=evsrestapi-util -Dversion=1.0.0

